para('Version 2.0 • Repository cleanup 11 October 2026; platform checks 10 October 2026')
para('A streaming engineering project with an original Netflix-inspired experience, independently deployable services, Kubernetes controls and a staged GitHub Actions → Argo CD delivery path.')
heading('Read this first',2)
para('This document explains the implemented v2 repository and its deployment prerequisites. A three-node streamflix-v2 learning cluster now runs version-pinned platform controllers and observability. All 28 Prometheus targets passed, logs were collected from all active platform namespaces, a synthetic trace was retrieved from Tempo, and HTTPS and cross-node policy enforcement passed. Application releases still await GitHub Actions; no production cloud provisioning or Argo CD sync has been performed.')
para('Production readiness is a property of the deployed system and its operating practices. The production profile validates required configuration and uses external resilient data services. Real payment capture, adaptive video encoding, content entitlements/DRM, commercial media rights, an account recovery system and multi-region operations remain explicit boundaries.')
